# Literal fragments of a known trip instance, base64-encoded.
#
# Obfuscation, not encryption — the same device the fleet's context-hygiene gate
# uses. The goal is that this repository contains zero readable mention of a
# stay window: a gate that grepped for "2026-08-13" in clear text would publish
# the very date it protects, and would do so in the file everyone reads first.
#
# One encoded fragment per line. Blank lines and lines starting with '#' are
# ignored. Matching is case-insensitive and applies to every tracked text file.
#
# Add a fragment here when a new instance is planned; never remove one, since a
# past stay window still discloses a past absence.

MjAyNi0wOC0xMw==
MjAyNi0wOC0yNw==
MTMg4oaSIDI3
MTMtMjcgYW/Du3Q=
MiBhZHVsdGVz
MTQgbnVpdHM=
dHdvIGFkdWx0cw==
